error[unresolved-type] 3:41-3:42
  (let [ids (fn [items] (map (fn [i] (get i :id)) items))]
                                          ^
  The checker cannot tell which record this is, so it cannot read a field from it.
  The parameter items of ids is passed [], {}, or none at a call, and nothing gives that value a type. The other calls of ids pass items as different types: List<Record {id: String}>; List<Record {id: String, size: Int}>.
  Pass ids a value of the right shape at this call, or pass the same type for items at every call.
